    "head_commit_message": "chore(ci): open questions point to issues, with a check and the skills changed (spec 36 step 2)\n\nOPEN_QUESTIONS.md's Open section becomes a pointer to issues labelled\n`question` and the migration's Q<n> -> #<issue> table; its header says\nhow to raise, check and close one, and Closed stays as written.\nci/github/check_open_questions.py (and its pre-commit hook) fails when\nan entry is added under Open. CLAUDE.md and agent-sessions.md rule 5\nname issues as the register. /run-phase lists `question` issues, opens\nits PR with the GitHub tools, sets the spec's milestone and step, kind\nand area labels, and says Closes #N; /handoff raises questions as issues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UpoKCwsdmuqwdp3dY9Jj6h",
